1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,150
Senior Sister,

25
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:56,120
Senior Brother Qian Mu forbade us from following him.

26
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,950
When he comes out and sees all this,

27
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,720
do you think he will scold us

28
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:00,990
for acting without his permission ?

29
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:04,750
We just built a residence near his cave,

30
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,040
it's nothing serious.

31
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,070
Besides,

32
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:09,110
cultivators like good environments.

33
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:12,320
We made this place this beautiful,

34
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,550
he won’t get angry.

35
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:15,950
Junior Sister Liu Wei,

36
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,070
you can relax.

37
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,440
After we spread rumors of Senior Brother Qian Mu,

38
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:24,230
I’ve collected a year's worth of souls in just a few months.

39
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:25,990
However...

40
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,310
Senior Sister,

41
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,150
visitors are getting more frequent.

42
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,550
If Senior Brother Qian Mu finds out

43
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:35,150
we’ve been using his reputation to collect souls,

44
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,830
he won’t forgive us !

45
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,270
I don't think so...

46
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,560
Junior Brother Qian Mu,

47
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:44,800
Guo Dongjian
Soul Refining Sect Inner disciple
Early stage Nascent Soul

48
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,430
I am Guo Dongjian.

49
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,150
I hope we can talk.

50
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,630
Nascent Soul cultivation !

51
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:08,360
Damn it,

52
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:09,550
we're in big trouble !

53
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,240
Go !

54
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:52,520
A Thousand-Soul Flag illusion ?

55
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:57,680
Thousand-Soul Flag

56
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:55,750
I also have

57
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,680
a Thousand-Soul Flag !

58
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,560
Surrender your Soul Flag

59
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:00,760
and I’ll let you leave.

60
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,920
If you can defeat me,

61
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,200
I’ll hand it over.

62
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,080
Senior Brother, be careful !

63
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,560
Vortex !

64
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:21,040
Among the Soul Refining Mountain disciples

65
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:23,030
only 2 have mastered the Soul Vortex...

66
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,480
How is this possible ?

67
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:30,480
3 months ago

68
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:30,350
Is this...

69
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,910
This beast is stronger than me,

70
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,000
I shouldn't act recklessly.

71
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,860
For now, I must focus on using the Spirit Vein to cultivate

72
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,520
and restore my Origin Soul.

73
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:20,120
Now that my cultivation is at Peak Nascent Soul,

74
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,750
it might be worth

75
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,310
studying Soul Flag spells.

76
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,600
The 3 Soul Refining Mountain spells are

77
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:28,830
Condense,

78
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:29,990
Soul Vortex

79
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,110
and Blood Sacrifice.

80
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,750
Condense

81
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:35,080
is the foundation of Soul Refining.

82
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,470
It shapes ethereal souls

83
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,280
into tangible forms

84
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,640
and puts them

85
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,360
inside a Soul Flag.

86
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,430
The Soul Vortex spell

87
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,400
is very rare.

88
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,960
Only at Nascent Soul

89
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,280
can one try to master it.

90
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,280
Vortex

91
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,720
Once the Soul Vortex is activated

92
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:54,110
it can rapidly absorb large amounts of souls.

93
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:57,710
Whether it is used for fighting or stealing souls

94
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:00,190
it is extremely powerful.

95
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,200
Congratulations, Senior Brother Qian Mu, on mastering the Soul Vortex...

96
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,390
Junior offers this Thousand-Soul Flag as a gift.

97
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:12,840
This Junior

98
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,080
will take his leave.

99
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,560
Wait.

100
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:23,440
Do you know who in the Soul Extracting Mountain has the jade slip ?

101
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,080
Su Jinshi of the Soul Extracting Mountain,

102
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,640
you can trade with him.

103
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:02,110
I congratulate Brother Qian Mu

104
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,600
on recovering most of his cultivation.

105
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:09,880
Liu Mei,

106
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,670
what are you here for ?

107
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,040
Don't make things up.

108
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,320
Wang Lin,

109
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,680
you’re in grave danger.

110
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,640
You must leave.

111
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,040
Leave planet Suzaku.

112
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,510
You don't know

113
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:24,280
but Red Butterfly was killed by my Senior Brother.

114
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,520
It looks like my duel with Red Butterfly

115
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:33,590
was merely a dogfight for certain people...

116
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:41,430
Leave,

117
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,550
the sooner, the better.

118
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,360
I’m doing this for you.

119
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,710
Liu Mei appears kind

120
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,430
but I keep having this weird feeling about her...

121
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,480
The weak expressions of these two...

122
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:09,950
Senior Brother, be careful !

123
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,750
Now I understand...

124
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:18,350
Liu Mei is showing all those emotions

125
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:21,670
to keep her true ruthless nature

126
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:24,310
hidden deep in her heart.

127
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,760
Liu Mei didn’t attack me while my cultivation was weak.

128
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:31,600
Her goal isn't killing me

129
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,720
but she definitely doesn’t have any good intentions.

130
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:38,120
Since you two helped me see Liu Mei’s true nature,

131
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,390
I’ll spare your lives.

132
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:42,550
The most urgent matter now

133
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,320
is mending my Origin Soul.

134
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,350
If I absorb more energy

135
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,350
and increase the pressure,

136
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:58,240
it will further compress my Origin Soul

137
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,880
and speed up my recovery.

138
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:23,120
Wang Lin's avatar
Early stage Soul Formation

139
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,230
I am back at Soul Formation

140
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,670
but my Origin Soul's healing has stopped.

141
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:26,240
Mending my Origin Soul

142
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:28,920
will require stronger spiritual energy pressure.

143
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,080
Damn animal !

144
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,880
The Ancestor has decreed that

145
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:47,110
the 3 Soul Flags beneath the 3 mountains

146
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:46,800
Ten Thousand-Soul Flag

147
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:49,640
belong whoever who can refine them.

148
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,230
After my last failure,

149
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,070
I spent decades preparing.

150
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:55,550
This time

151
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:58,030
you will surely be mine !

152
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,790
Blood Sacrifice !

153
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:20,670
Blood Sacrifice,

154
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,200
the last of the 3 Soul Refining spells.

155
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:24,750
It can multiply the Soul Flag’s power

156
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,750
by several times.

157
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,430
There's one more ?

158
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,950
Finally, you're out.

159
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,920
Soul Sealing Bell

160
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:49,190
I lost last time to this second primary soul.

161
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:51,430
This time, I’ll capture you !

162
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,560
It's working !

163
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:20,280
How come there's a third primary soul !?

164
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,280
Could there be

165
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,270
a fourth one ?

166
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:25,800
Enough,

167
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,950
I’ll return later.

168
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,320
It's weird,

169
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,790
a single Soul Flag can’t have so many primary souls.

170
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:44,080
There is only one possibility,

171
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,950
they’re all secondary souls.

172
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:53,120
I must keep taunting the secondary souls

173
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:55,200
to force the primary soul out.

174
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,760
Subduing this Soul Flag

175
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,600
is worth a try !

176
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,640
Is this

177
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,320
a Qilin soul fragment ?

178
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,750
This Qilin soul fragment

179
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:35,500
even if it's weaker than Ling Tianhou’s living Qilin,

180
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,080
has a memory inheritance

181
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,880
and can cast spells.

182
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,100
Its power

183
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:42,760
is comparable to Peak Late stage Soul Formation.

184
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:48,520
Vortex !

185
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,230
Let’s see

186
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:52,750
how long your soul energy can last !

187
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,960
Damn animal !

188
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,150
God Slaying Chariot,

189
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,040
activate !

190
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,990
If you were at full strength

191
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:45,160
you wouldn’t fear a beast soul.

192
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,720
But now,

193
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:48,150
you’re just a soul fragment.

194
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:01,440
Hundred Thousand-Soul Flag

195
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,550
A Hundred Thousand-Soul Flag !?

196
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,110
Rise !

197
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,560
Qilin primary soul,

198
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,240
return !

199
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,310
The energy fluctuations

200
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:50,600
didn’t attract the attention of the Soul Refining Sect’s Soul Formation Elders.

201
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,540
The top priority now

202
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:56,760
is to gather the 3 jade slips of spells for the Soul Flag.

203
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:03,280
Su Jinshi
Soul Refining Sect Inner disciple

204
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:11,070
A Soul Refining Mountain disciple ?

205
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:13,480
Hand over the Soul Extracting jade slip.

206
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,550
I can’t see through his cultivation...

207
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:21,470
I can give you the Soul Extracting jade slip

208
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:24,390
but I have a Soul Flag

209
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:27,230
that is still missing 300 souls fragments

210
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:30,200
to become a Thousand-Soul Flag.

211
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,960
If you can give me 300 souls,

212
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:33,400
I’ll give it to you.

213
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:50,000
Senior Brother is decisive,

214
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:51,880
how should I address you ?

215
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,360
Qian Mu.

216
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:56,240
So it’s Senior Brother Qian Mu.

217
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:59,080
Soul Extracting jade

218
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,000
This jade slip

219
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,720
records how to extract souls

220
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:04,870
and

221
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:08,200
the method to prevent them from dissipating.

222
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:14,390
Senior Brother Qian Mu,

223
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:19,110
do you plan to get the Soul Sealing jade next ?

224
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:24,120
Senior Brother, don’t bother.

225
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,640
The Soul Sealing jade slip

226
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:28,520
is only accessible to Soul Formation Elders.

227
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,030
Ordinary disciples

228
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:33,160
only use Soul Refining and Extracting.

229
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:37,060
The final Soul Flag spell

230
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:39,310
is only for Soul Formation Elders ?

231
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:41,310
My Origin Soul’s recovery

232
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:43,390
requires even greater pressure.

233
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,390
In that case,

234
00:16:48,400 --> 00:16:48,950
why not.

235
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,240
Elders of the Soul Refining Sect,

236
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:08,520
come out and fight me !

237
00:17:28,620 --> 00:17:31,920
To let go of the consequences of my actions

238
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,640
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

239
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:35,580
like scattered ink.

240
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:43,060
As destiny falls

241
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:43,060
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

242
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:50,660
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

243
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:50,660
wither and melt into rivers.

244
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:58,220
Who can deceive

245
00:17:53,860 --> 00:17:58,220
the law of the heavens ?

246
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:01,540
Countless generations

247
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:01,540
have tried before me.

248
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:05,260
But how could I not catch my dreams

249
00:18:03,660 --> 00:18:05,260
within my warm fingers ?

250
00:18:05,820 --> 00:18:09,340
You're at my side when I'm alone

251
00:18:09,340 --> 00:18:12,660
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

252
00:18:13,420 --> 00:18:16,620
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

253
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:20,820
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

254
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:20,820
in the streets.

255
00:18:20,980 --> 00:18:25,780
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

256
00:18:22,540 --> 00:18:25,780
Can I break the rules ?

257
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:28,500
To run towards you !

258
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:31,820
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

259
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:36,460
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

260
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:39,860
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

261
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:44,540
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

262
00:18:44,990 --> 00:18:50,220
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

263
00:18:50,340 --> 00:18:54,140
If your soul is willing to wander,

264
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:58,780
can I still take your hands

265
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:58,780
and hold them tight ?

266
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:01,860
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

267
00:19:01,860 --> 00:19:06,740
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

268
00:19:06,750 --> 00:19:10,020
I dream of destroying

269
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:14,740
the shackles of our fate.

270
00:19:14,740 --> 00:19:18,700
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

271
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:21,500
You're the hardest to let go of.

272
00:19:21,580 --> 00:19:25,380
I want to be with you again

273
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:28,740
so I can look in your eyes.

274
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:33,980
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
